hadiths[61]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1193","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Log Quraish ke tabe hain is mamle mein. Un ke musalman un ke musalmanon ke tabe, un ke kafir un ke kafiron ke tabe."
"1194","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ye mamla hamesha Quraish mein rahega jab tak un mein se do baqi rahein."
"1195","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Samura aur un ke walid Samura bin Junada al-Suwai se riwayat hai. Jabir bin Samura ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Barah ameer honge. Phir Aap ne ek kalima farmaya jo main ne na suna. Phir mere walid ne kaha: Beshak Aap ne farmaya: Wo sab Quraish mein se honge."
"1196","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar se Abdullah bin Umar ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar se kaha gaya: Kya tum khalifa nahi banaoge? Unhon ne kaha: Agar main khalifa banaun to beshak us ne khalifa banaya jo mujh se behtar tha, Abu Bakr. Aur agar chhor dun to beshak us ne chhora jo mujh se behtar tha, Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam). Phir unhon ne Aap ki tareef ki. To unhon ne farmaya: Ragbat aur dar. Main chahta hun ke main is se barabar bach jaun, na mere liye na mujh par. Main use zinda aur murda nahi uthayunga."
"1197","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abd al-Rahman bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abd al-Rahman bin Samura! Imarat na mango. Kyunke agar tumhe wo mangne se di gayi to tum us ke hawale kiye jaoge. Aur agar tumhe wo baghair mange di gayi to tumhari madad ki jayegi."
"1198","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa aur Muadh bin Jabal (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai. Abu Musa ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya jabke mere sath Ash'ariyon mein se do mard they, ek mere dayein ek mere bayein. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) miswak kar rahe they. Phir dono ne manga. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Musa! Ya Abdullah bin Qais! Unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne tumhe haq ke sath bheja! Unhon ne mujhe apne dilon mein jo tha na bataya. Aur mujhe ilm na tha ke wo kaam mangte hain. Phir goya main Aap ki miswak Aap ke honth ke neeche dekhta hun, simat gayi. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Hum apne kaam par use kabhi muqarrar nahi karenge jo use chahe. Lekin jao tum ae Abu Musa! Ya Abdullah bin Qais! Yemen ki taraf. Phir Aap ke peechhe Muadh bin Jabal aaye. Phir jab Wo un ke paas aaye to unhon ne un ke liye takiya dala. Unhon ne kaha: Utro. Jabke un ke paas ek shakhs bandha tha. Unhon ne kaha: Ye kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Wo Yahoodi tha phir musalman hua phir Yahoodi ho gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Baitho. Unhon ne kaha: Main nahi baithunga yahan tak ke wo qatl kiya jaye. Allah aur Us ke Rasool ka faisla, teen martaba. Phir Aap ne us ka hukm diya aur wo qatl kiya gaya. Phir dono ne raat ke qayam ka zikr kiya. Phir un mein se ek ne kaha: Raha main, qayam karta hun aur sota hun. Aur apni neend mein us ki ummeed rakhta hun jo apne qayam mein ummeed rakhta hun."
"1199","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum sab nigran ho aur apni riaya ke bare mein poochhe jaoge. Phir ameer jo logon par hai nigran hai aur un ke bare mein poochha jayega. Aur mard apne ghar walon par nigran hai aur un ke bare mein poochha jayega. Aur aurat apne shohar ke ghar aur us ki aulad par nigran hai aur un ke bare mein poochhi jayegi. Aur ghulam apne aaqa ke maal par nigran hai aur us ke bare mein poochha jayega. Suno! Tum sab nigran ho aur tum sab apni riaya ke bare mein poochhe jaoge."
"1200","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ma'qil bin Yasar se Hasan ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Ubaidullah bin Ziyad ne Ma'qil bin Yasar ki us bimari mein ayadat ki jis mein Wo faut hue. Phir Ma'qil ne un se kaha: Beshak main tumhe ek hadith bayan karta hun jo main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suni hai. Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Jo banda ho jise Allah riaya ka zimmedar banaye phir wo us ki khair-khwahi se hifazat na kare to wo Jannat ki khushboo nahi payega."
"1201","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hum mein khade hue aur khayanat ka zikr farmaya. Phir use bada bataya aur us ke mamle ko bada bataya. Aap ne farmaya: Main tum mein se ek ko Qayamat ke din na paun jabke us ki gardan par bakri ho jis ki awaz ho. Us ki gardan par ghoda ho jis ki awaz ho. Wo kahe: Ya Rasulullah! Meri madad farmayiye. Phir main kahun: Main tumhare liye kuchh nahi rakhta. Main tumhe pahuncha chuka. Aur us ki gardan par oont ho jis ki awaz ho. Wo kahe: Ya Rasulullah! Meri madad farmayiye. Phir main kahun: Main tumhare liye kuchh nahi rakhta. Main tumhe pahuncha chuka. Aur us ki gardan par sona-chandi ho. Phir wo kahe: Ya Rasulullah! Meri madad farmayiye. Phir main kahun: Main tumhare liye kuchh nahi rakhta. Main tumhe pahuncha chuka. Ya us ki gardan par kapde hon jo hilein. Phir wo kahe: Ya Rasulullah! Meri madad farmayiye. Phir main kahun: Main tumhare liye kuchh nahi rakhta. Main tumhe pahuncha chuka."
"1202","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Humaid al-Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek karkun muqarrar farmaya. Phir karkun Aap ke paas aaya jab apne kaam se farigh hua. Phir us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye tumhare liye hai, aur ye mujhe hadiya kiya gaya. To Aap ne us se farmaya: Kya tum apne baap aur maan ke ghar mein nahi baithe aur dekha ke tumhe hadiya diya jata hai ya nahi? Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) shaam ko namaz ke baad khade hue. Phir shahadat parhi aur Allah ki sana bayan ki jis ka Wo ahl hai. Phir farmaya: Amma ba'd! Phir karkun ka kya haal hai jise hum muqarrar karte hain? Phir wo hamare paas aata hai aur kehta hai ye tumhare kaam mein se hai, aur ye mujhe hadiya kiya gaya. Kya wo apne baap aur maan ke ghar mein nahi baitha aur dekha ke use hadiya diya jata hai ya nahi? Phir Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Tum mein se koi us mein se kuchh khayanat nahi karega magar Qayamat ke din use apni gardan par uthaye aayega. Agar oont hua to use layega jis ki awaz hogi. Agar gaay hui to use layega jis ki awaz hogi. Agar bakri hui to use layega jo bolegi. Phir main ne pahuncha diya. Phir Abu Humaid ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apna hath uthaya yahan tak ke hum Aap ki baghalon ki safedi dekhte they."
"1203","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se [Allah ki itaat karo, Rasool ki itaat karo aur apne hukm walon ki] ke bare mein riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ye Abdullah bin Huzafa bin Qais bin Adi ke bare mein nazil hui, jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe lashkar mein bheja tha."
"1204","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo meri itaat kare us ne Allah ki itaat ki. Aur jo meri na-farmani kare us ne Allah ki na-farmani ki. Aur jo mere ameer ki itaat kare us ne meri itaat ki. Aur jo mere ameer ki na-farmani kare us ne meri na-farmani ki."
"1205","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs par sunna aur itaat hai us mein jo pasand kare aur na-pasand kare, jab tak use na-farmani ka hukm na diya jaye. Phir jab use na-farmani ka hukm diya jaye to sunna aur itaat nahi."
"1206","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne lashkar bheja aur un par Ansar mein se ek mard ko ameer banaya. Aur unhe hukm diya ke us ki itaat karein. Phir wo un par ghazab-naak hua. Aur kaha: Kya Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hukm nahi farmaya ke tum meri itaat karo? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Us ne kaha: Main tumhe qasam deta hun ke jab tum ne lakdiyan jama ki hon aur aag jalayi ho phir us mein dakhil ho jao. Phir unhon ne lakdiyan jama ki aur aag jalayi. Phir jab unhon ne dakhil hone ka irada kiya to ek doosre ki taraf dekhne khade hue. Un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Hum to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki pairwi Aag se bhag kar ki. Phir kya hum us mein dakhil hon? Phir jab wo aise they to aag bujh gayi aur us ka ghussa thehra. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr kiya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar wo us mein dakhil hote to us se kabhi na nikalte. Beshak itaat neki mein hai."
"1207","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubada bin al-Samit se Junada bin Abi Umayya ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Ubada bin al-Samit ke paas dakhil hue jabke Wo beemar they. Hum ne kaha: Allah tumhe durust kare. Hadith bayan karo jo tumhe Allah us se faida de, jo tum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suni hai. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein bulaya aur hum ne Aap se bai'at ki. Phir Aap ne us mein farmaya jo hum se liya: Ke Aap ne hum se bai'at li sunne aur itaat par, hamari chusti aur susti mein, tangi aur aasani mein, hum par tarjeeh mein. Aur ke hum mamle walon se mamla na chheenein magar ye ke tum wazeh kufr dekho jis mein tumhare paas Allah ki taraf se daleel ho."
"1208","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Bani Israil ki siyasat Ambiya karte they. Jab Nabi halak hota to Nabi us ka khalifa hota. Aur beshak mere baad Nabi nahi. Aur anqareeb khalifa honge aur zyada honge. Unhon ne arz kiya: Phir tum hamein kya hukm farmate ho? Aap ne farmaya: Pehli bai'at ko poora karo. Unhe un ka haq do. Kyunke Allah un se poochhega jo unhe zimmedar banaya."
"1209","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Anqareeb tarjeeh aur mamle honge jinhe tum na-pasand karoge. Unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Phir tum hamein kya hukm farmate ho? Aap ne farmaya: Tum wo haq ada karoge jo tum par hai aur Allah se mangoge jo tumhare liye hai."
"1210","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usaid bin Hudair (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ansar mein se ek mard ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum mujhe muqarrar nahi karoge jaisa tum ne falan ko muqarrar kiya? Aap ne farmaya: Tum mere baad tarjeeh paoge. Phir sabr karo yahan tak ke mujh se Hauz par milo."
"1211","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifa bin al-Yaman se Abu Idris al-Khaulani ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Huzaifa bin al-Yaman ko kehte suna: Log Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bhalayi ke bare mein poochhte they. Aur main Aap se shar ke bare mein poochhta tha, is dar se ke wo mujhe pa le. Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak hum jahiliyat aur shar mein they. Phir Allah hamein ye bhalayi lekar aaya. Phir kya is bhalayi ke baad shar hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Main ne arz kiya: Aur kya us shar ke baad bhalayi hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, aur us mein dhund hai. Main ne arz kiya: Aur us ka dhund kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Qaum jo meri hidayat ke siwa hidayat dete hain. Tum un mein se pehchanoge aur inkar karoge. Main ne arz kiya: Phir kya us bhalayi ke baad shar hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Jahannam ke darwazon ki taraf bulane wale. Jo unhe us ki taraf jawab dega wo use us mein phenkenge. Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Unhe hamare liye bayan farmayiye. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo hamari khaal se hain aur hamari zabano se bolte hain. Main ne arz kiya: Phir tum mujhe kya hukm farmate ho agar wo mujhe pa le? Aap ne farmaya: Musalmanon ki jamaat aur un ke imam se chipak jao. Main ne arz kiya: Phir agar un ki jamaat aur imam na ho? Aap ne farmaya: Phir un tamam girohon se alag raho, agarche tumhe darakht ki jad chabani pade yahan tak ke tumhe maut aa jaye jabke tum is par ho."
"1212","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo apne ameer se koi cheez na-pasand kare wo sabr kare. Kyunke jo hukumat se balisht bhar nikla wo jahiliyat ki maut mara."
"1213","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hum se Hudaibiya ke din farmaya: Tum zameen walon mein sab se behtar ho. Aur hum chaudah sau they. Aur agar main aaj dekh sakta to tumhe darakht ki jagah dikhata."
"1214","[AI-translation] Hazrat Musayyab bin Hazn (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak main ne darakht dekha. Phir us ke baad us ke paas aaya to use na pehchana."
"1215","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salama bin al-Akwa se Yazid bin Abi Ubaid ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Salama bin al-Akwa se kaha: Tum ne Hudaibiya ke din Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kis par bai'at ki? Unhon ne kaha: Maut par."
"1216","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Harra ka zamana tha to un ke paas aane wala aaya. Phir us ne un se kaha: Beshak Ibn Hanzala logon se maut par bai'at leta hai. To unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baad is par kisi se bai'at nahi karunga."
"1217","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salama bin al-Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Hajjaj ke paas dakhil hue. To us ne kaha: Ae Ibn al-Akwa! Tum apni ediyon par phir gaye? Tum dehati ho gaye? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Lekin Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe dehat mein ijazat di thi."
"1218","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mujashi bin Mas'ud aur Abu Ma'bad se Abu Usman al-Nahdi ke hawale se, Mujashi bin Mas'ud se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Ma'bad ko Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas le gaya taake Aap se hijrat par bai'at karein. Aap ne farmaya: Hijrat apne walon ke liye guzar gayi. Main Aap se Islam aur jihad par bai'at karta hun. Phir main Abu Ma'bad se mila aur un se poochha. To unhon ne kaha: Mujashi ne sach kaha."
"1219","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Makkah ki fatah ke din farmaya: Hijrat nahi, lekin jihad aur niyat hai. Aur jab tumhe nikalne ke liye kaha jaye to niklo."
"1220","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek dehati ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se hijrat ke bare mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum par afsos! Beshak us ka mamla sakht hai. Phir kya tumhare paas oont hain jis ka sadqa ada karte ho? Us ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Phir samandaron ke peechhe amal karo. Kyunke Allah tumhare amal mein se kuchh kam nahi karega."
"1221","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Momin aurtein jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf hijrat karti thein to Wo unhe Allah Ta'ala ke qaul [ae iman walo! Jab tumhare paas momin aurtein hijrat karke aayein to unhe aazmao] ayat ke aakhir tak se aazmate. Aisha ne kaha: Phir momin aurton mein se jo is shart ka iqrar karti wo aazmaish ka iqrar karti. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab wo apne qaul se is ka iqrar karteen to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un se farmate: Jao, main ne tum se bai'at ki. Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka hath kabhi aurat ke hath ko nahi laga, magar Aap un se kalam se bai'at farmate. Allah ki qasam! Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aurton se us ke siwa nahi liya jis ka Allah ne Aap ko hukm farmaya. Aap un se farmate jab un se lete: Main ne tum se kalam se bai'at ki."
"1222","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se sunne aur itaat par bai'at karte to Wo hum se farmate: Jitni taqat rakho."
"1223","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use Uhud ke din pesh kiya jabke wo chaudah saal ke they. Phir mujhe ijazat na di. Phir mujhe Khandaq ke din pesh kiya jabke main pandrah ka tha. Phir mujhe ijazat di."
"1224","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne dushman ki zameen ki taraf Quran lekar safar karne se mana farmaya."
"1225","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ghodon ke darmiyan daud lagwayi jo taiyar kiye gaye they, Hafya se, un ki had Thaniyat al-Wada thi. Aur un ghodon ke darmiyan daud lagwayi jo taiyar na kiye gaye they, Thaniya se Bani Zuraiq ki masjid tak. Aur Abdullah bin Umar un mein they jo us se daud lagate."
"1226","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ghodon ki peshaniyon mein Qayamat ke din tak bhalayi hai."
"1227","[AI-translation] Hazrat Urwa al-Bariqi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ghodon ki peshaniyon mein Qayamat ke din tak bhalayi bandhi hui hai: Ajr aur ghaneemat."
"1228","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Barkat ghodon ki peshaniyon mein hai."
"1229","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah us ke liye ayaan hua jo Us ke raste mein nikla. Use sirf mujh par iman aur mere Rasoolon ki tasdeeq nikalti hai, ke main use lautayun jo us ne ajr ya ghaneemat mein paya, ya use Jannat mein dakhil karun. Aur agar main apni ummat par mushqqat na dalta to lashkar ke peechhe na baithta. Aur main chahta hun ke main Allah ke raste mein qatl kiya jaun, phir zinda hun, phir qatl kiya jaun, phir zinda hun, phir qatl kiya jaun."
"1230","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah us ka zamin hua jo Us ke raste mein jihad kare. Use sirf Us ke raste mein jihad aur Us ke kalimon ki tasdeeq nikalti hai, ke Wo use Jannat mein dakhil kare, ya use us ke maskan ki taraf lautaye jis se wo nikla tha, ajr ya ghaneemat ke sath."
"1231","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Har zakhm jo Musalman Allah ke raste mein zakhmi ho, Qayamat ke din us ki haalat jaisa hoga jab mara gaya tha. Khoon behta hua. Rang khoon ka rang aur khushboo mushk ki khushboo."
"1232","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Koi Jannat mein dakhil hone wala pasand nahi karta ke duniya ki taraf laute, jabke us ke liye zameen par jo hai us mein se kuchh hai, siwaye shaheed ke. Wo tamanna karta hai ke duniya ki taraf laute aur dus martaba qatl kiya jaye, us izzat ki wajah se jo wo dekhta hai."
"1233","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Mujhe aise amal ki rahnumayi farmayiye jo jihad ke barabar ho. Aap ne farmaya: Main use nahi pata. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum taqat rakhte ho ke jab mujahid nikle to tum apni masjid mein dakhil ho aur khade raho aur sust na ho, roza rakho aur iftar na karo? Us ne arz kiya: Aur kaun is ki taqat rakhta hai?"
"1234","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke raste mein subah ya shaam chalna duniya aur jo us mein hai us se behtar hai."
"1235","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke raste mein shaam aur subah chalna duniya aur jo us mein hai us se afzal hai."
"1236","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke raste mein subah ya shaam chalna us se behtar hai jis par suraj tulu aur ghuroob hota hai."
"1237","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Arz kiya gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Logon mein se kaun afzal hai? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Momin jo Allah ke raste mein apni jaan aur maal se jihad kare. Unhon ne arz kiya: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Momin jo ghatiyon mein se ek ghati mein Allah se darta hai aur logon ko apne shar se chhore."
"1238","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Allah do mardon par hansta hai, un mein se ek doosre ko qatl karta hai, dono Jannat mein dakhil hote hain. Ye Allah ke raste mein ladta hai aur qatl kiya jata hai. Phir Allah qatil par tawajjah farmata hai aur wo shaheed hota hai]."
"1239","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke raste mein ladne wale ko tayyar kare us ne ladayi ki. Aur jo ladne wale ke peechhe Allah ke raste mein bhalayi se rahe us ne ladayi ki."
"1240","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab ye nazil hui [baithne wale momin barabar nahi] to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Zaid ko bulaya. Phir wo kandha lekar aaye aur use likha. Aur Ibn Umm Maktum ne apne nuqsan ki shikayat ki. Phir ye nazil hui [baithne wale momin barabar nahi, siwaye nuqsan walon ke]."
"1241","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Uhud ke din ek shakhs ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha: Batayiye, agar main qatl kiya jaun to main kahan hun? Aap ne farmaya: Jannat mein. Phir us ne apne hath mein khajoorein phenkein. Phir lada yahan tak ke qatl ho gaya."
"1242","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Bani Sulaim mein se qaumon ko Bani Amir ki taraf bheja, sattar mein. Phir jab wo aaye to un se mere mamun ne kaha: Kya main tum se aage badhun? Phir agar wo mujhe aman dein yahan tak ke unhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se pahunchaun, warna main tum se qareeb tha. Phir wo aage badhe. Phir unhon ne use aman di. Phir jab Wo unhe Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayan kar rahe they to unhon ne un mein se ek shakhs ki taraf ishara kiya. Phir us ne use neze se mara aur paar kar diya. Phir us ne kaha: Allahu Akbar! Main kamyab ho gaya, Kaaba ke Rab ki qasam! Phir wo baqi sathiyon par toote aur unhe qatl kiya, siwaye langde shakhs ke jo pahad par chadha. Hammam ne kaha [sanad ke ek rawi]: Phir main use us ke sath doosra samajhta hun. Phir Jibreel (alaihissalam) ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar di ke wo apne Rab se mile. Phir Wo un se raazi hua aur unhe raazi kiya. Phir hum parhte they ke apni qaum ko pahunchao ke hum apne Rab se mile. Phir Wo hum se raazi hua aur hamein raazi kiya. Phir is ke baad mansookh hua. Phir Aap ne un par chalees subah bad-dua farmayi: Ri'l, Dhakwan, Bani Lihyan aur Bani Usayya par jinhon ne Allah aur Us ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki na-farmani ki."
"1243","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Shakhs ghaneemat ke liye ladta hai, shakhs zikr ke liye ladta hai, shakhs ladta hai taake us ki jagah dekhi jaye. Phir kaun Allah ke raste mein hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jo ladے taake Allah ka kalima sab se buland ho wo Allah ke raste mein hai."
"1244","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Allah ke raste mein ladayi kya hai? Kyunke hum mein se ek ghusse se ladta hai, hamiyyat se ladta hai. Phir Aap ne us ki taraf apna sar uthaya [unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap ne us ki taraf apna sar sirf is liye uthaya ke Wo khade they]. Phir farmaya: Jo ladے taake Allah ka kalima sab se buland ho wo Allah Azza wa Jalla ke raste mein hai."
"1245","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak aamal niyat se hain. Aur beshak aadmi ke liye wahi hai jo us ne niyat ki. Phir jis ki hijrat Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki taraf ho, us ki hijrat Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki taraf hai. Aur jis ki hijrat duniya ki taraf ho jo wo paye, ya aurat ki taraf ho jis se wo nikah kare, us ki hijrat us ki taraf hai jis ki taraf us ne hijrat ki."
"1246","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Umm Haram bint Milhan ke paas dakhil hote aur Wo Aap ko khilatin. Aur Umm Haram Ubada bin al-Samit ke nikah mein thein. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas dakhil hue. Phir unhon ne Aap ko khilaya. Aur Aap ke sar se juwein nikalne lagein. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) so gaye. Phir bedar hue jabke Wo hans rahe they. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne arz kiya: Tumhe kya hansata hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se log mujhe dikhaye gaye jo Allah ke raste mein ladne wale hain, is samandar ki peeth par sawar, takhton par badshah ya takhton par badshahon jaisa. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Allah se dua farmayiye ke Wo mujhe un mein se bana de. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ke liye dua farmayi. Phir Aap ne apna sar rakha. Phir bedar hue jabke Wo hans rahe they. Phir main ne arz kiya: Tumhe kya hansata hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se log mujhe dikhaye gaye jo Allah ke raste mein ladne wale hain jaisa pehli martaba farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Allah se dua farmayiye ke Wo mujhe un mein se bana de. Aap ne farmaya: Tum pehle walon mein se ho. Phir Wo samandar mein sawar huein, Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan ke zamane mein. Phir apni sawari se gir padein jab samandar se niklein. Phir halak ho gayein."
"1247","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi raste mein chalta hua raste par kaante ki tehni paye to use peechhe kare. Phir Allah ne us ka shukr ada kiya aur use bakhsh diya. Phir farmaya: Shaheed paanch hain: Ta'oon wala, pet wala, doobne wala, dabne wala aur Allah ke raste mein shaheed."
"1248","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ta'oon har Musalman ke liye shahadat hai."
"1249","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughira bin Shu'ba (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se log hamesha zahir rahenge yahan tak ke un ke paas Allah ka hukm aaye jabke wo zahir honge."
"1250","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muawiya (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Meri ummat mein se ek ummat hamesha Allah ke hukm par qayam rahegi. Unhe wo nuqsan nahi dega jo unhe ruswa kare na jo un ki mukhalifat kare, yahan tak ke un ke paas Allah ka hukm aaye jabke wo is par honge."
"1251","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Safar azab ka tukda hai. Tum mein se ek ka khana, peena aur sona rokta hai. Phir jab apni hajat poori kare to apne ghar walon ki taraf jaldi kare."
"1252","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne ghar walon ke paas raat mein na aate. Aap subah ya shaam ke siwa dakhil na hote."
"1253","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ladayi se laute. Phir jab hum ne dakhil hona chaha to Aap ne farmaya: Thehro yahan tak ke raat mein dakhil ho [matlab shaam mein], taake bikhar baalon wali kanghi kare aur ghayab wali safayi kare."
